[00:00.00] 作词 : Morgan Wallen/Grady Block/Jamie McLaughlin/Ernest Keith Smith/Ryan Vojtesak
[00:00.00][by:波罗猫与海鸥心]
[00:01.00] 作曲 : Morgan Wallen/Grady Block/Jamie McLaughlin/Ernest Keith Smith/Ryan Vojtesak
[00:12.98] You say I'll never change
[00:12.98] 你说我本性难移
[00:15.31] A-just a go around town with some gasoline
[00:15.31] 就像带着汽油在城中徘徊
[00:18.07] Just tryin' to bum a flame
[00:18.07] 一心只想寻得一丝火苗
[00:20.66] Gonna burn the whole place down
[00:20.66] 妄图将这一切付之一炬
[00:23.41] And how do you explain
[00:23.41] 可你又该如何解释
[00:25.87] Ever fallin' in love with a guy like me in the first place?
[00:25.87] 最初为何会爱上我这样的人
[00:29.99] Then turn around, say that I'm the worst thing
[00:29.99] 而后却又转身 称我是最不堪之人
[00:32.69]
[00:32.86] I guess I'm the problem
[00:32.86] 我想 我便是那症结所在
[00:35.84] And you're Miss Never-Do-No-Wrong
[00:35.84] 而你 宛如那从无过错的完美小姐
[00:38.30] If I'm so awful
[00:38.30] 倘若我如此不堪
[00:41.05] Then why'd you stick around this long
[00:41.05] 那你为何还在我身旁长久相伴
[00:43.40] And if it's the whiskey
[00:43.40] 若这一切归咎于威士忌
[00:45.59] Then why you keep on pullin' it off the shelf?
[00:45.59] 那你为何总将它从架子上取下
[00:49.35] You hate that when you look at me, you halfway see yourself
[00:49.35] 你厌恶在看向我时 仿佛看到了半个自己
[00:53.77] And it got me thinkin'
[00:53.77] 这不禁让我思索
[00:56.52] If I'm the problem
[00:56.52] 若我是问题的根源
[00:58.64] Well, you might be the reason
[00:58.64] 那么 你或许就是背后的缘由
[01:00.68]
[01:10.09] We try to go our separate ways
[01:10.09] 我们试图各奔东西
[01:12.70] And we're back and forth like a swingin' door
[01:12.70] 却似一扇摇摆不定的门 徘徊往复
[01:15.45] And tomorrow's like yesterday
[01:15.45] 明日与昨日并无二致
[01:18.14] Some days better than the night before
[01:18.14] 有时会比前一晚稍好一些
[01:20.57] And you're back with me again
[01:20.57] 你再次回到我身边
[01:23.24] Then you go and tell your friends
[01:23.24] 随后却又去向朋友们倾诉
[01:25.16]
[01:25.37] That I'm the problem
[01:25.37] 坚称我就是问题所在
[01:28.01] And you're Miss Never-Do-No-Wrong
[01:28.01] 而你依旧是那无错的完美小姐
[01:30.50] If I'm so awful
[01:30.50] 若我这般糟糕透顶
[01:33.20] Then why'd you stick around this long
[01:33.20] 那你缘何还在我身边停留许久
[01:35.54] And if it's the whiskey
[01:35.54] 若问题出在威士忌上
[01:37.80] Then why you keep on pullin' it off the shelf?
[01:37.80] 那你为何总是将它从架上取下
[01:41.50] You hate that when you look at me, you halfway see yourself
[01:41.50] 你憎恶在看向我时 察觉到自己的影子
[01:45.95] And it got me thinkin'
[01:45.95] 这让我陷入沉思
[01:48.68] If I'm the problem
[01:48.68] 若我是引发矛盾的症结
[01:50.83] Well, you might be the reason
[01:50.83] 那么 你或许就是致使问题产生的原因
[01:53.22]
[02:02.70] If I'm such a waste of breath, such a waste of time
[02:02.70] 若我如此让你觉得浪费精力 浪费时间
[02:07.62] Then why you on your way to waste another Friday night?
[02:07.62] 那你为何又要赶来 浪费又一个周五的夜晚
[02:11.67]
